+# Internal HTTP Policy
+
+This project requires HTTPS for all connections, with no exception for internal hosts: an earlier allowance for plain HTTP to internal hosts was reversed in favor of a uniform HTTPS-everywhere policy, so plaintext HTTP to internal hosts is not permitted.
